ee261280b3d4c207af50 3x"}, "body": "Hello. I would like to see Freyja (https://imgur.com/eESMkLT https://imgur.com/4yw9rVe) from Fire Emblem Heroes marrying the summoner (https://imgur.com/PN1mB9T).\n\nFreyja should be wearing a wedding dress, I trust you to be able to give her one that has inspirations from her default outfit. The two should look joyus, with smiles on their faces.\n\nIf possible, alternate versions with a hoodless varient of the summoner would be appreciated.\n\nYou can find hoodless versions here: https://fireemblem.fandom.com/wiki/Kiran/Gallery (one example: https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/fireemblem/images/0/0d/Kiran_M_Custom_2_Heroes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20210204100056)\n\nI would like the summoner to be wearing their normal robes, but if you wish (as in, this is optional) you may make a varient where they are wearing something more suitable for a groom.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noah_maruart/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1782623, "client_id": 255335, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/70c82bb8/uploads/origins/11c205f3-a500-44c1-95b1-8f4708b9d2ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa5dcbc8e9cc2bc72ded9c75bf443918", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/70c82bb8/uploads/origins/11c205f3-a500-44c1-95b1-8f4708b9d2ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa5dcbc8e9cc2bc72ded9c75bf443918, https://si.imgix.net/70c82bb8/uploads/origins/11c205f3-a500-44c1-95b1-8f4708b9d2ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e79a7a74bab7223eb971ee0ed3180903 2x, https://si.imgix.net/70c82bb8/uploads/origins/11c205f3-a500-44c1-95b1-8f4708b9d2ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac8a4bd6c860a45cb63